#EXTM3U
#
# MP3 Player for Analogue Pocket -- playlist
#
# One file per line. Lines starting with # are ignored, so you can leave
# notes to yourself in here (and the #EXTM3U / #EXTINF lines that other
# players write are skipped automatically).
#
# Paths are relative to this folder, /Assets/mp3player/common/ :
#
#   Feel Good Inc.mp3
#   Rhinestone Eyes.mp3
#
# ...or you can point somewhere else on the card with a full path:
#
#   /Music/Albums/Demon Days/01 Intro.mp3
#
# Up to 128 tracks. Save the file, and either relaunch the core or use
# Load Playlist from the Analogue menu to pick it up.
#
# Delete these comment lines when you add your own tracks -- or don't,
# they cost nothing.
#
# --- your tracks below this line ---
